.TH murk-setup-merge-driver 1  "setup-merge-driver " 
.SH NAME
murk\-setup\-merge\-driver \- Configure git to use murk\*(Aqs merge driver for vault files named `*.murk` or `.murk.*` (experimental)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmurk setup\-merge\-driver\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure git to use murk\*(Aqs merge driver for vault files named `*.murk` or `.murk.*` (experimental)
.PP
Adds `*.murk merge=murk` and `.murk.* merge=murk` to the `.gitattributes` at the root of the working tree, and sets `merge.murk.*` in git config. A file that matches but is not a vault is merged as text.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
